ories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","review_id":"eGHLj_Yis-cdZbfKQTUV0w","date":"2019-03-10T14:45:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.939347505569458,"text_excerpt":"Really enjoyed our dinner here. The Brussel sprouts started was amazing - we will definitely be back for this. My friend got that burger (and loved it). My wife & I shared the shrimp rings (unique and tasty) and the fried bahn mi sandwich (also delicious). Good drinks. Good service. We liked sitting outside (though we did have 2 homeless people ask us for $$ while we were eating - but we were sitting on Magazine St - so not unexpected). We will definitely be back."},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","review_id":"mSz41Tajjqx8PPQbkfTGhQ","date":"2018-12-05T16:23:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9322910308837891,"text_excerpt":"I have been hearing nothing but rave reviews about this place and how funky it is. So, me and a friend decided to go and try it out for ourselves. The interior is nicely decorated with funky paintings and modern decor. We were greeted at the door and immediately seated. The beer selection was top notch, with a sense of the hipster, but I do not complain. Beer is beer for me. The food is what I like to write about and I can honestly say the burger that I ordered was delicious! The poppy seeded bun adds to the burger. Yes, I just ordered the classic (I think the name is \"That Burger?\"). My friend ordered the very fancy burger and was very impressed with how all of those ingredients come tog..."},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","review_id":"tzYjduRSCSN3KMdBJ8z3Ig","date":"2019-01-08T18:42:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9281765818595886,"text_excerpt":"No problems with this place. The food was really good. I had one of the burgers. Meat, cheese, all of that was good, but what I liked most was the bread was homemade -- or at least tasted like it was. Try the Mac and cheese as well. The '90s hip hop music was a cool addition to the vibe inside."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","photo_id":"S4-QX7LXxFrKU8HUiKV0nw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/S4-QX7LXxFrKU8HUiKV0nw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.866780161857605},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","photo_id":"AhxaR1Rqm2eX9EeDEl-PRA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AhxaR1Rqm2eX9EeDEl-PRA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468998670578003},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","photo_id":"9mVj3XAtlp6NNVUupY03iw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9mVj3XAtlp6NNVUupY03iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8213471174240112},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","photo_id":"WFl9USpnY5qsIupI5RoEFA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WFl9USpnY5qsIupI5RoEFA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8115513324737549},{"business_id":"z7q_oWGr3GlvYqfiTfeljA","photo_id":"uLeINW9pl_e3-uxRpzO2mg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uLeINW9pl_e3-uxRpzO2mg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8049781918525696}]},"notebook_case":null}
